id: pm-namespace-recovery-delivery
title: Deliver unambiguous registry-derived namespace recovery across installed Node and Bun consumers
description: "Execution child of the canonical recovery feature for GH-1433. Derive a canonical help retry for a misplaced registered namespace suffix, refuse ambiguous or unavailable routes and preserve nonempty item/history bytes through real installed npm/npx and Bun/bunx consumers. The parent retains the complete recovery-census programme."
